flowchart TD
    input[Input CZI plate] --> metadata[Parse CziMetadata once]
    metadata --> layout[Resolve plate, well, field, and scene layout]
    metadata --> pyramid[Detect stored CZI pyramid levels]
    layout --> queue[Create bounded field job queue]
    pyramid --> queue
    queue --> scene[Select one scene for one field]
    scene --> levels[Build lazy multiscale arrays]
    levels --> decision{Stored coarse level available?}
    decision -- Yes --> stored[Read stored CZI subblocks]
    decision -- No --> native[Read lower level with native libCZI zoom]
    stored --> chunks[Rechunk spatial axes toward 512 x 512]
    native --> chunks
    chunks --> ngff[Create NGFF multiscales and OMERO metadata]
    ngff --> writer[ngff-zarr HCSPlateWriter]
    writer --> shard[Configure Zarr v3 indexed sharding]
    shard --> compress[Compress inner chunks with Blosc]
    compress --> field[Write plate / well / field / scale arrays]
    field --> remaining{More fields?}
    remaining -- Yes --> queue
    remaining -- No --> validate[Validate OME-NGFF v0.5 output]